{
  "$description": "ERI design tokens: the one source for @eri/components and every ERI app. Three layers: primitive (raw brand values), semantic (what a value is for; refers to a primitive), component (refers to a semantic token). Light is the $value; the dark value is in $extensions[\"org.exponentialroadmap.mode\"].dark. Build: node scripts/build-tokens.mjs. Check: node scripts/check-tokens.mjs.",
